    "2": {
      "note": "Tier 2 zooms in on shopping for clothes. Sizes use a <em>maa5</em> (碼) suffix: <em>daai6 maa5</em> (大碼, large), <em>zung1 maa5</em> (中碼, medium), <em>sai3 maa5</em> (細碼, small). The most useful verb is <strong>si3</strong> (試, to try on) — almost always paired with <em>haa5</em> as <em>si3 haa5</em> ('try a bit'). Note <em>gan2</em> (緊, tight) and <em>sung1</em> (鬆, loose) — these describe how clothes fit and also work in general 'tight/loose' contexts.",
